  m_text: Immerse yourself in a bright and exciting world where you become a ball
    that must demonstrate agility and reaction! In this dynamic arcade game, your
    goal is to jump on colored tiles, avoiding falling into the abyss. At the beginning
    of each game, you will be given a certain color. To survive and move on, you
    need to jump only on tiles of this color. Each correct landing brings points
    and increases the speed of the game, which makes every second tense and exciting!
